{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "On when your Mac already announces replies through Bark, so they don't arrive twice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actívalo si tu Mac ya te avisa por Bark, para que no te lleguen dos veces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En este iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendario"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every account on this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todas las cuentas de este iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep, activity, heart and medication · WHOOP, Apple Watch": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sueño, actividad, corazón y medicación · WHOOP, Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your events are deleted from your Hermes and your agents stop seeing them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus eventos se borran de tu Hermes y tus agentes dejan de verlos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin conectar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications via Bark": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avisos por Bark"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apariencia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a passcode for this iPhone to lock Alice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pon un código a este iPhone para bloquear Alice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They show again the next time Alice opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volverán a salir la próxima vez que abras Alice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent work": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabajo de agentes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect Health?": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Desconectar Salud?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alice stops reading Health and your Hermes forgets the days it kept. Nothing in Health changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alice deja de leer Salud y tu Hermes olvida los días que guardaba. En Salud no cambia nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep, activity, heart and medication, one summary a day to your own Hermes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sueño, actividad, corazón y medicación: un resumen al día para tu propio Hermes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also brings what your WHOOP or Apple Watch writes to Health.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "También trae lo que tu WHOOP o Apple Watch escriben en Salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never ask me for codes here": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No volver a pedirme códigos aquí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the key the site gives when you set up an authenticator app (\"setup key\" or \"can't scan the code?\"). It is kept encrypted with this login in Hermes on your Mac, and Alice makes the codes herself from now on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pega la clave que da la web al configurar una app de autenticación («clave de configuración» o «¿no puedes escanear el código?»). Se guarda cifrada con este login en Hermes, en tu Mac, y a partir de ahora Alice genera los códigos sola."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setup key or otpauth:// link": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clave de configuración o enlace otpauth://"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a code instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escribir un código"
          }
        }
      }
    },
