        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Integraciones (MCP)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from the notes store, with what its agent made of it. This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se quita del almacén de notas, con lo que su agente hizo de ella. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It leaves the notes store, with what its agent made of it. Recently Deleted keeps a copy on this iPhone for 30 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sale del almacén de notas, con lo que su agente hizo de ella. Eliminados recientemente conserva una copia en este iPhone durante 30 días."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its notes are not deleted. They go back to Quick Notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sus notas no se eliminan. Vuelven a Notas rápidas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its plan and history go. Routines working on it keep running until you stop them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se borran su plan y su historial. Las rutinas que trabajan en él siguen hasta que las pares."
